{"slug":"single-number-iii","id":260,"title":"Single Number III","difficulty":"Medium","tags":[],"fn":"singleNumber","params":[["nums","int[]"]],"types":["int[]"],"ret":"int[]","cmp":"sorted","desc":"<p>給你一個整數陣列 nums，其中<strong>恰好有兩個元素只出現一次</strong>，其餘所有元素均出現兩次。找出只出現一次的那兩個元素。你可以按<strong>任意順序</strong>返回答案。</p>\n<p>要求：時間複雜度 <strong>O(n)</strong>，空間複雜度 <strong>O(1)</strong>。</p>","constraints":[],"starter":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def singleNumber(self, nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n        ","typescript":"function singleNumber(nums: number[]): number[] {\n    \n};","javascript":"/**\n * @param {number[]} nums\n * @return {number[]}\n */\nvar singleNumber = function(nums) {\n    \n};"},"examples":[{"args":[[1,2,1,3,2,5]],"out":[3,5]},{"args":[[-1,0]],"out":[-1,0]},{"args":[[0,1]],"out":[1,0]}],"tests":[{"args":[[0,1]],"out":[1,0]},{"args":[[-1,0]],"out":[-1,0]},{"args":[[-2147483648,2147483647]],"out":[2147483647,-2147483648]},{"args":[[-175063320,606276261,-1834489277,-729437345,1942217190,-1834489277,1584257230,817615909,727648227,1626708618,-2052104201,-1197582981,1942217190,-729437345,-1929184132,-2052104201,1560980768,1626708618,606276261,1242644596,1584257230,-1675987026,-569077623,-509939981,1158042610,1158042610,1607117734,-1929184132,727648227,-1197582981,-509939981,921016073,1560980768,2042735936,1051797117,2042735936,-569077623,1051797117,-1236618956,-1236618956,1242644596,-175063320,1655903539,-1675987026,1655903539,1607117734]],"out":[817615909,921016073]},{"args":[[1130915101,1053083334,-749277717,-1636408745,-831095235,-1500578756,2077800069,1764359981,-1196700231,-1677991976,-1216469623,-764389287,279046367,1232959393,-1363770003,18507747,-1636408745,1047158072,-665656552,248326484,18507747,248326484,1232959393,-514763683,-621949124,2077800069,-749277717,-1677991976,-621949124,486481342,-1196700231,486481342,-514763683,-1363770003,-665656552,1764359981,-1500578756,279046367,1047158072,-1216469623,1130915101,-831095235]],"out":[-764389287,1053083